Rule Name: maps-app-description

Description:
The "maps" application is a web-based interactive mapping tool with advanced routing capabilities.
Key features include:
*   Interactive map display with zooming, panning, and user location tracking.
*   Plotting routes with waypoints, supporting both road-snapped and direct (straight-line) waypoints.
*   Route management features: adding/removing waypoints, undo/redo, and route reset.
*   Calculation and display of route distance (km) and estimated travel time (minutes).
*   Ability to share routes via URL, import/export routes in GPX format.
*   User interface includes location search, route controls (undo, redo, reset, locate me, lock route view, cycle time of day), and a sidebar for detailed route information and actions.
*   Supports different map styles for day/night and various light presets (dawn, day, dusk, night).

Technology Stack:
*   Framework: React 19 with TypeScript
*   Mapping: Mapbox GL JS and React Map GL
*   Styling: Tailwind CSS
*   Build Tool: Vite
*   Package Manager: Bun
